Server-enforced project/action boundary (authorize() single entry point),
single-use HMAC-bound approvals, bounded reviewable session grants, and a
14-section deterministic regression suite. Adds a per-agent shell/session
contract proposal doc for the later core-feature gate.

Isolated draft for a separate review gate; depends on PR #1
(authentication) for verified identity. No authentication, runtime, or
deployment behavior is modified by this commit.

